{"id":"n53915-2-8","stage":4,"title":"뛰쳐나가다 · 脱离","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n53915-2-8-1","ko":"사고가 어떻게 일어나게 된 거죠?","zh":"事故是怎么发生的呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사고가","meaning":"事故","explanation":"사고：事故；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사고","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66370","senseId":"1","lemma":"사고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사고가","audio":"/audio/ba0733d3ab65ceb9dbe1.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"일어나게","meaning":"发生，起","explanation":"일어나다：发生，起；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"일어나다","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71696","senseId":"3","lemma":"일어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일어나게","audio":"/audio/cb4a6ca25457a9fb5e10.mp3"}},{"text":"된","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"된","audio":"/audio/1c4305152ccc1be2241e.mp3"}},{"text":"거죠?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거죠","audio":"/audio/d739482dc8a726917f44.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2b04ea5b795422b7","term":"사고","zh":"事故","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3","entryId":"66370","definition":"意料之外发生的不好的事情。","pronunciation":["사ː고"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"d57c47b0949440ff","term":"일어나다","zh":"发生，起","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3","entryId":"71696","definition":"事情或事件等产生。","pronunciation":["이러나다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/3265a6b58c0ea742a452.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n53915-2-8-2","ko":"이 아이가 파란불이 켜지기도 전에 횡단보도에서 뛰쳐나갔어요.","zh":"这孩子还没等绿灯亮就冲出了人行横道。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"아이가","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이가","audio":"/audio/820c647554b7d3f4fc3a.mp3"}},{"text":"파란불이","meaning":"蓝；火","explanation":"파랗다：蓝；불：火；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"파랗다","audio":"/audio/27555478331997f6bc6b.mp3"},{"term":"불","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71306","senseId":"1","lemma":"파랗다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"61154","senseId":"2","lemma":"불","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"파란불이","audio":"/audio/8e61c12ba3656a13c950.mp3"}},{"text":"켜지기도","meaning":"打开，发动；表示成为前面表达的那样。","explanation":"켜다：打开，发动；지다：表示成为前面表达的那样。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"켜다","audio":"/audio/c21cbaed08b52b5bb6d4.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72168","senseId":"2","lemma":"켜다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"2","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"켜지기도","audio":"/audio/adc4e42760cb6744b006.mp3"}},{"text":"전에","meaning":"前","explanation":"전：前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17301","senseId":"2","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전에","audio":"/audio/2d406c50ea3b8c668815.mp3"}},{"text":"횡단보도에서","meaning":"人行横道，斑马线","explanation":"횡단보도：人行横道，斑马线；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"횡단보도","audio":"/audio/1be9bc555fce2a5014b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73246","senseId":"1","lemma":"횡단보도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"횡단보도에서","audio":"/audio/bff4d5182ab7688ddaab.mp3"}},{"text":"뛰쳐나갔어요.","meaning":"脱离，出走","explanation":"뛰쳐나가다：脱离，出走；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"뛰쳐나가다","audio":"/audio/9e77e3d8fe37255ecc6a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53915","senseId":"2","lemma":"뛰쳐나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뛰쳐나갔어요","audio":"/audio/b04d16e5275df78284ab.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"27555478331997f6","term":"파랗다",